  "first_page_identity_excerpt": "Highlights\nCross-Device Neural Architecture Latency Rank Transfer from De-\nvice Communality: Theory and Validation\nFaraz Kayani, Sarmad Kayani, Radu Timofte, Dmitry Ignatov\n•Closed-form law predicts cross-device latency rank transfer from device\ncommunality.\n•Communality, not reliability, governs transfer under architecture dom-\ninance.\n•Predictions are cryptographically pre-registered, then validated on five\nmobile SoCs.\n•Blind external replication on four edge devices, including an Intel Myr-\niad VPU.\n•The model correctly predicts its own breakdown when noise indepen-\ndence is violated.",
